Package: vy-termweb
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: YotserLab <contato@yotserlab.local>
Recommends: ffmpeg
Description: Web-based SSH/SFTP terminal and infrastructure manager
 VY-TermWEB is a browser-based terminal and infrastructure manager.
 It provides real SSH/SFTP sessions, a local PTY
 shell, SSH port forwarding (local/remote/dynamic), a graphical file
 manager, a Monaco text editor and a network scanner — all served by a
 single self-contained Go binary with the frontend embedded.
 .
 The daemon listens on 0.0.0.0:PORT (default 32230) and runs as the
 system user configured in /etc/default/vy-termweb.
